WEBVTT

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:03.260
Nine hundred and ninety-eight.

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:06.370
Nine hundred and ninety-nine.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:07.990
One thousand!

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:10.690
Let's break...

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.640
...the limit!

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.680
Ray, want to go buy some 
protein after school?

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.130
I'm sorry, but I must refuse!

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.230
After school, I'm...

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:22.170
Here you go.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.660
What is this?

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.440
The spare key to our club's room.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.170
None of the other club 
members can make it today.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:33.460
I think you'll be there 
even before Miss Rebecca.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:34.830
Understood.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:37.510
Thank you for taking the trouble 
to tell me, Miss Sera.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:40.790
I-It's no big deal.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.640
Anyway, thanks for doing it.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:56.030
U-S-A!

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.610
Miss Rebecca?

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:09.840
My deepest apologies.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:16.320
I guess she likes bunnies.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:45.710
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:48.020
<b>Episode 4
The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Releases His Secret Power!</b>

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:50.470
Um, so...

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:54.170
This is tea made from some plants 
grown by the gardening club.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:56.350
I hope you like it.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.420
Miss Rebecca,

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:00.430
even though it was an accident,

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:02.200
I am terribly sorry for what happened.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:05.290
Y-You really don't have to say all that.

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:10.430
I just happened to be changing in there 
because my gym class ended early.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:11.430
Usually...

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:18.140
U-Usually... I wear much 
more grown-up underwear.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.340
Oh, I see!

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:20.780
That's wonderful!

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:21.890
Yes.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.140
So please forget about what you saw!

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:25.890
Understood!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.000
Jeez!

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:34.180
So, what is this book?

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.890
It seems to be more worn than the others.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:38.320
Oh, that one.

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:42.910
Those are the collective records 
of the gardening club.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:47.620
There is even information in there that 
regular illustrated guides don't have.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.780
That's really amazing.

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:51.170
Have you written in it, too?

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:52.090
Yes.

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:57.580
I have specifically added notes about 
flowers that were modified by sorcery.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.350
By sorcery?

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:00.330
That's right!

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:07.860
For example, this plant here 
is able to use sorcery.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.040
Really?

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:11.620
Plants have the capacity to do that?

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:12.450
They do!

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:14.810
This is particularly common 
in carnivorous plants.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:16.010
Through the process of evolution,

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:19.100
they've begun displaying phenomena 
similar to sorcery.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:22.080
The mysteries of life.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.390
That's right!

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:27.450
Speaking of, your marigolds 
also have their own entry.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.120
I'd love to see that.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:32.370
Is something the matter?

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:33.930
Oh, nothing.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:38.620
I'm just happy that I can teach 
a new member things like this.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:44.230
But there are other members 
in the club, right?

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.150
Sure.

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:50.430
I suppose since I'm from one 
of the three great houses

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.880
people can't help but keep me at a distance.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.550
They're all lovely people,

00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:58.970
but when I try to show them something 
like this, they politely decline.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:03.310
I suppose I also find it 
difficult to open up.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:08.200
That's why I am happy that
you're so easy to talk to!

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.580
If you don't mind,

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:14.980
then I'd love to continue receiving 
lessons like this from you.

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:18.180
Well, I can be a strict teacher.

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.580
I sure hope so.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:24.050
May I borrow this 
book to do some studying?

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.340
Of course!

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:29.380
That reminds me.

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:32.950
You'll be on the organizational staff 
for the Magic Chevalier, correct?

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:33.790
That's right.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.560
I thought I'd go cheer on Amelia.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:40.760
Amelia is the big favorite 
for the rookie bracket.

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:44.560
The daughter of House Rose, 
the leader of the three great houses.

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:45.940
Speaking of,

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:50.620
is there nobody from the third 
family at this academy?

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.170
That's right.

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:55.830
The Algrens have traditionally attended 
the Diom Academy of Sorcery.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:56.950
I see.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:00.210
That house also has an eldest daughter.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:05.350
So I think she'll be a 
good rival for Amelia.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.820
The Magic Chevalier is upon us.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.040
The academies will soon begin 
their preliminary rounds

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:18.310
and select their representatives.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.230
In the rookie bracket,

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.310
you will be facing off 
against fellow first-years,

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:26.700
meaning that anybody who's 
planning to enter is your rival.

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:32.270
The winner is Amelia Rose!

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:35.530
Sir?

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:37.320
Yes?

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:41.250
May I please fight Ray next?

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.070
What?

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:44.780
Miss Amelia wants to fight that nobody?!

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:47.060
How dare that withered scum?!

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:49.130
She will crush him, no doubt.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.060
But White is not going to 
be one of the partici—

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:53.330
Ray White...

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.900
Will you be my opponent?

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:59.410
Professor Arkwright, I have no objections.

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:04.160
And begin!

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:10.670
<i>Not too heavy...</i>

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:12.190
<i>but fast!</i>

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:18.670
You're quite the mystery, Ray.

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:21.960
You're not very skilled when it comes 
to sorcery, yet you excel at the sword.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.580
Your skill in actual battle in the 
Kafka Forest was amazing, too.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:28.160
That's why I wanted to 
fight you at least once.

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.280
I see.

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:31.080
Those words make me happy.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.590
Let's improve together, then.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:35.820
Yes!

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:42.240
So strong! So beautiful! So exquisite!

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:46.650
<i>I will land a hit!</i>

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:51.160
<i>Oh, this feeling...</i>

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:24.020
A-And the winner is... Amelia Rose!

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.980
You really are amazing.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.280
Ray, that last... that last thing.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:40.950
What was that?

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.030
That was just...

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:47.770
Who... Who are you really?

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.920
That damn ordinary!

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:59.290
I would've loved to see that!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.310
It was a close fight, huh?

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:02.870
I guess.

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.560
You both looked so cool.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:09.360
But you're really something with the sword.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.920
Where did you learn that?

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.820
I have a master.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.030
A master?

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.160
Who teaches you sword fighting?

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.170
Not just that.

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:24.050
Sword fighting, sorcery, 
what kind of person to be...

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:25.820
so all sorts of things.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:28.440
She's my mentor in everything, basically.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.120
It was pretty brutal, though.

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:33.840
She was that strict?

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:35.970
Yes.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:40.070
So much so that life here feels like heaven.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:40.860
You know,

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:45.030
maybe that ordinary is 
actually really something.

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:47.360
He was first in the Kafka Forest, too.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.960
I figured they'd naturally win since 
Miss Amelia was on their team,

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:53.350
but maybe it was actually because of him?

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:58.700
Ray White.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:01.080
I hereby challenge you to a duel!

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.360
You better not run!

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:03.480
Don't pee yourself!

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:05.790
Or soil yourself another way!

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:07.870
Sure.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:08.750
I accept.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:17.370
You think he'll be okay?

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:20.160
I can help him, if it comes to that.

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:24.980
There's a barrier around this entire area.

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:28.520
Is it so nobody hears the sounds?

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.430
Mr. Alium, what are the rules for the duel?

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:33.880
Use this.

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:38.020
Needless to say, the use of 
sorcery is permitted, as well.

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:40.410
Al?!

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.610
Are you serious?

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:42.710
What?

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:44.120
You're using a real sword?

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:46.980
Whoever admits defeat is the loser.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:48.610
Beyond that...

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.890
we need no rules!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.910
Ray White...

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:01.560
I'll kill you myself!

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:12.520
What's wrong?

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:14.970
Come here and fight, ordinary!

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:17.910
<i>Is this just him getting worked up?</i>

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:18.980
<i>Or is it...</i>

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:21.780
There is no way I will lose to you.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:24.330
If I can compile sorcery...

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:27.700
there is no way I can lose 
to a muscle brain like you!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:28.530
Ray!

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:31.780
<i>I... I...!</i>

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:36.400
<i>I was born to be the heir to House Alium.</i>

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:39.350
<i>House Alium is a noble line.</i>

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:43.930
<i>Even so, we're in the lower 
echelons of the middle tier.</i>

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.830
<i>A far cry from being notable.</i>

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:50.990
<i>Over this, I had seen my father 
humiliated countless times.</i>

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:54.230
<i>So I decided what the purpose 
of my life shall be.</i>

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:58.600
<i>I will raise up the name of 
House Alium and ensure that we thrive.</i>

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.430
<i>I will relentlessly work at it,</i>

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:03.250
<i>and eventually become a grand sorcerer.</i>

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:04.470
<i>Kill...</i>

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:07.670
<i>Kill Ray White!</i>

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.970
Is dodging all you can do?!

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:16.990
<i>If it's just a little...</i>

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.270
What?!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:29.290
He cut the spell?!

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:33.610
Mr. Alium, let me teach 
you how big our world is.

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:36.650
Shut up!

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:37.440
Ray!

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:37.790
Ray!

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.020
Back!

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:44.050
Damn it! Damn it, damn it, damn it!

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:45.930
Stop!

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:46.990
What is going on?!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.740
Why won't any of them hit?!

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:53.660
Y-You!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.690
You must actually be a noble!

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:57.970
You're some hidden bastard of 
one of the three great houses!

00:12:57.970 --> 00:12:58.990
Aren't you?!

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:01.900
I was definitely born an ordinary.

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:05.800
And yet, despite my birth,

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.040
I can use sorcery and 
I can also fight like this.

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:14.310
Mr. Alium, I understand that 
heritage is very important to you,

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:18.810
but that doesn't mean
you're a great sorcerer.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.060
Damn it!

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.860
Then eat this!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:23.980
Hey, Al!

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:25.730
Isn't that an Extensive?!

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:30.250
Febris Draco!

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:32.440
Ray!

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:56.310
I...

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:58.760
What on earth am I...

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.510
Ray, you're...

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.790
You have to tell us now.

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:18.960
Who are you?

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:21.790
I'm...

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:37.900
This is...

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:42.210
Spectacular.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.030
It really was spectacular.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.450
That is youth for you.

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:49.240
But you will now all become 
living sacrifices.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:52.280
But do not despair.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.400
You will be contributing to the 
development of a magnificent sorcery.

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:58.420
Is that not something to be proud of?

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:00.030
Is it not?

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.200
Hmm?

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:03.910
Ray White?

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:05.790
Professor Gray?!

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:11.680
Such an exciting situation! 
It really makes the heart sing.

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:13.550
R-Ray!

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:16.690
I'll explain myself when this is over.

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.050
No more secrets.

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:21.370
But please wait for just a little longer.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:26.950
It looks like I have no choice 
but to fight Professor Gray.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:31.300
You are obviously no average person.

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:33.360
Neither are you.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.820
And now I understand.

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:37.960
Oh?

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:41.940
Share your thoughts, White.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:46.440
You belong to Eugenics.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:51.060
Your aim is to get the students' engrams.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:52.460
The brains of sorcerers.

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:56.720
I'm sure those expelled students you 
alluded to are also a part of this.

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:01.120
You are correct, Ray White.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:03.810
I don't dislike sharp people.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:06.970
And now I've become 
interested in your engram.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:13.230
You were trying to abduct students in 
the Kafka Forest during that exercise.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.480
That monster that had no 
business being there...

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:17.570
You were controlling it.

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:19.150
Correct again.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:20.390
Truly impressive.

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:23.250
That exercise is a yearly godsend.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:27.550
It's so easy to excuse that another 
student disappeared from the academy.

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:29.530
And then, oh, how I mourn them!

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:34.210
The tragedy's heroine: 
"No, why did it have to be my students?!"

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:36.010
Something like that.

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:39.880
You're the one who 
incited Mr. Alium, as well.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:41.640
What an idiot.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:46.150
Only his pride is big enough to measure. 
The rest of him is pathetic trash.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:52.810
But in the end, he was a convenient stall 
for time while I erected this powerful barrier.

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:04.130
I got a promising crop of 
students in one fell swoop.

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:06.150
With this many brains,

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:09.120
my standing in Eugenics will rise, as well!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:13.710
So everything you told 
me was a complete lie.

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:15.390
Obviously.

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:18.320
You had caught my eye.

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:24.150
I always talk to students privately 
when I'm interested in them.

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:28.890
As the considerate and 
compassionate teacher.

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:29.710
So, how did I do?

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:32.390
I played the part well, don't you agree?

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:37.420
Please be prepared to lose an 
arm or two, Professor Gray.

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:40.900
What? You're still calling me "Professor"?

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:43.560
All right, Ray White.

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:45.950
You truly are interesting.

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:51.020
I'll keep you alive while I study 
that engram in your brain.

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:53.550
Whoa!

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:58.400
You're a sorcerer who has specialized 
in close-quarters combat, right?

00:17:58.400 --> 00:17:59.700
And despite being an ordinary,

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:03.020
you seem to have an abnormally 
high capacity for prima materia.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:06.660
But as long as you can't get near me, 
there is nothing you can do!

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:08.640
Fire Snake!

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:16.320
Now what are you going to do, Ray White?

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:19.500
Watching you just run away isn't amusing.

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.320
So then, what about this?

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:30.050
I'll take you all down at once!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.300
<i>However, once the time comes,</i>

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:35.040
<i>you have to make that call.</i>

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:37.260
<i>After all, I did pass the mantle of...</i>

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:39.960
Chronos Lock, release!

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:46.990
What is this?!

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:48.060
What's happening?

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:54.150
I'm sorry, Master...

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:57.490
But I must do this to protect everyone.

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:02.730
Icicle Blades!

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:10.530
Blades... of ice?!

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:11.720
This can't be!

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:14.280
An I-Iceblade?!

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:20.940
They said the Iceblade Sorcerer 
disappeared in the Far East War!

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:22.770
That's true.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:26.420
But the Iceblade Sorcerer 
title had been passed on.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:29.150
To a certain boy...

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:33.700
This can't be, this can't be, 
this can't be!

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:35.100
This can't be happening!

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:38.860
Stop spewing... lies!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.220
So what if you have iceblades?!

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:53.490
Even if you are one of the seven grand 
sorcerors, you can't block this!

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:56.570
Causality Draco!

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:02.100
Antimaterial Code, activate.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.280
It disappeared?

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:10.550
How?

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:11.950
Professor Gray,

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:15.550
why don't I show you the true 
nature of the Iceblade Sorcerer?

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:18.350
What are you saying?

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:20.360
What the hell are you?

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:23.310
Stay back! Stay back!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:31.540
Frame Lock.

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:36.240
That hurts!

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:42.380
Are you really...

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.880
Are you really <i>that</i> Iceblade?

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:47.020
That's right.

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:49.880
I am the Iceblade Sorcerer.

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:52.400
S-Stop!

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:54.440
W-W-W-W-Wait!

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.700
Okay, don't say another word.

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.450
Please just calm down.

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:03.440
Why don't I, I mean, may I 
introduce you to Eugenics?

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:05.390
Yeah, that's a great idea!

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:08.190
I'm sure they'd make you one of their leaders!

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:12.090
So please, let me go!

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:17.090
My research to unveil 
the truth cannot end here!

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:19.580
Please, I beg of you!

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:27.470
You idiot!

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:30.260
What?

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:32.730
What's wrong?

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:33.840
Is that it?

00:21:35.010 --> 00:21:36.910
You monster...

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:39.700
Is that all, Professor Gray?

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:47.420
I accept it.

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:51.270
Even as a platinum, I can't 
compete with grands.

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:54.680
But then the strongest of 
the seven grand sorcerers?

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:57.520
I just can't win.

00:22:01.970 --> 00:22:04.130
So what will you do with that?

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:06.790
You going to kill me with that iceblade?

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:07.840
No.

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:10.420
Your punishment will fit the crime.

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:13.350
You're going to capture me alive?

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:14.920
I see.

00:22:15.800 --> 00:22:17.320
So that's how it's going to be.

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:21.400
Looks like I'm gonna have to go all out, then!

00:22:24.140 --> 00:22:26.160
Dark Triad System!

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:29.560
Activate!

00:22:42.930 --> 00:22:46.350
You forced me to use this...

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:49.850
The result of all my research so far!

00:22:51.150 --> 00:22:57.110
Now, you better let me 
have some fun, Iceblade!

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:54.940
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

